{"lines": ["In December 1900, three men kept the lighthouse on a tiny island off the west coast of Scotland.", "Around midnight on December 15th, a passing steamer noticed that the light was dark.", "Storms kept the relief boat away for eleven days.", "No flag flew, and nobody answered its whistle, siren, or rocket.", "The relief keeper went ashore alone.", "The gate was shut, the beds were empty, and the clock had stopped.", "But the lamp was cleaned and filled, ready to be lit.", "Two sets of outdoor gear were gone.", "And Donald McArthur's coat was still hanging inside, so he had gone out in his shirt sleeves, in bad weather.", "At the west landing, iron railings were twisted, and a box kept 110 feet above the sea had been torn away.", "The inspector decided a huge wave had swept all three men off the rocks.", "No bodies were ever found, and no one has explained why McArthur ran out without his coat.", "We're halfway now, and the next three are ghost ships, found with nobody on board, and the same thing missing from every one."], "words": [["In", 0.0, 0.08], ["December", 0.08, 0.36], ["1900,", 0.36, 0.94], ["three", 1.64, 1.94], ["men", 1.94, 2.3], ["kept", 2.3, 2.52], ["the", 2.52, 2.76], ["lighthouse", 2.76, 3.0], ["on", 3.0, 3.42], ["a", 3.42, 3.5], ["tiny", 3.5, 3.76], ["island", 3.76, 4.34], ["off", 4.34, 4.86], ["the", 4.86, 5.04], ["west", 5.04, 5.24], ["coast", 5.24, 5.58], ["of", 5.58, 5.84], ["Scotland.", 5.84, 6.12], ["Around", 6.64, 6.96], ["midnight", 6.96, 7.28], ["on", 7.28, 7.86], ["December", 7.86, 8.12], ["15th,", 8.12, 8.98], ["a", 9.4, 9.45], ["passing", 9.45, 9.8], ["steamer", 9.8, 10.34], ["noticed", 10.34, 10.64], ["that", 10.64, 11.1], ["the", 11.1, 11.22], ["light", 11.22, 11.48], ["was", 11.48, 11.82], ["dark.", 11.82, 12.18], ["Storms", 12.78, 13.26], ["kept", 13.26, 13.42], ["the", 13.42, 13.66], ["relief", 13.66, 13.9], ["boat", 13.9, 14.24], ["away", 14.24, 14.62], ["for", 14.62, 15.0], ["eleven", 15.0, 15.2], ["days.", 15.2, 15.66],